-shaped abdomen.

416
00:22:43,890 --> 00:22:47,070
There is an underdeveloped
thoracic cavity

417
00:22:47,070 --> 00:22:50,220
which leads to
respiratory insufficiency

418
00:22:50,220 --> 00:22:53,690
and the patients
frequently die at birth.

419
00:22:54,630 --> 00:22:57,810
At the microscopic
level, the growth

420
00:22:57,810 --> 00:22:59,830
plate shows
reduced chondrocyte

421
00:22:59,830 --> 00:23:02,230
proliferation and
disorganization

422
00:23:02,230 --> 00:23:04,850
within the zone
of proliferation.

423
00:23:10,910 --> 00:23:12,290
Now let's
concentrate a little

424
00:23:12,290 --> 00:23:14,330
bit on achondroplasia
or dwarfism.

425
00:23:14,430 --> 00:23:17,390
This is an autosomal
dominant disorder

426
00:23:17,390 --> 00:23:19,430
characterized by
gain-of-function

427
00:23:19,430 --> 00:23:22,490
mutation in the FGFR
