which is exaggerated

430
00:23:30,750 --> 00:23:34,450
by FGFR3 gain of
function mutation

431
00:23:35,670 --> 00:23:38,490
the patients present
with ********

432
00:23:38,490 --> 00:23:41,830
cartilage growth,
shortened proximal

433
00:23:41,830 --> 00:23:44,090
extremities, enlarged
head with bulging

434
00:23:44,090 --> 00:23:47,290
forehead, depression
of root of nose despite

435
00:23:47,290 --> 00:23:49,550
trunk of relatively
normal length.

436
00:23:50,490 --> 00:23:52,670
It is not usually
associated

437
00:23:52,670 --> 00:23:54,050
