brittle bone disease.

469
00:25:41,350 --> 00:25:43,970
It represents the
most common inherited

470
00:25:43,970 --> 00:25:45,770
disorder of
connective tissue,

471
00:25:45,770 --> 00:25:49,190
phenotypically
heterogeneous caused by

472
00:25:49,190 --> 00:25:52,870
deficiencies in type
1 collagen synthesis

473
00:25:54,750 --> 00:25:57,070
mostly affects
bone but also

474
00:25:57,070 --> 00:25:59,490
other tissues with
type 1 collagen

475
00:25:59,770 --> 00:26:04,950
joints eyes ears skin
and teeth it is caused

476
00:26:04,950 --> 00:26:07,730
