and defective

480
00:26:16,630 --> 00:26:19,750
assembly of higher
order collagen chains

481
00:26:20,070 --> 00:26:26,310
mostly autosomal dominant
col1a1 or col1a2.

482
00:26:27,630 --> 00:26:29,230
In conclusion,

483
00:26:29,910 --> 00:26:31,170
the bone is formed but

484
00:26:31,170 --> 00:26:32,590
there is too little bone.

485
00:26:40,450 --> 00:26:42,530
The previously
mentioned mutations are

486
00:26:42,530 --> 00:26:45,090
very important as they
might determine the

487
00:26:45,090 --> 00:26:47,370
