fractures.

504
00:27:32,410 --> 00:27:34,070
Clinical features.

505
00:27:34,570 --> 00:27:37,040
The patient would
present with multiple

506
00:27:37,040 --> 00:27:39,050
fractures due to
minimal trauma.

507
00:27:39,650 --> 00:27:42,270
These are confused with

508
00:27:42,270 --> 00:27:44,370
some time with
child *****.

509
00:27:44,750 --> 00:27:48,990
The patient develops
hearing loss which

510
00:27:48,990 --> 00:27:51,690
is determined by
both a sensorineural

511
00:27:51,690 --> 00:27:53,590
